# 默认按文本处理，统一以 LF 存储，检出时按平台转换（避免 Windows/WSL 混用导致整文件 diff）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 图片 / 二进制
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.jar  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# 语言标记，便于 GitHub 统计与 diff
*.java   linguist-language=Java
*.vue    linguist-language=Vue
*.ts     linguist-language=TypeScript
*.md     linguist-documentation

# 生成物不参与统计与折叠
frontend/*/unpackage/** linguist-generated=true
**/dist/**               linguist-generated=true
**/node_modules/**       -linguist-detectable
